message: "If you use this software, please cite it as follows."
title: "NLP Skill Pipeline"
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Luis
    given-names: Tiago
    affiliation: Atlantic Technological University
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tiagoluis12/nlp-skill-pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype for extracting skill mentions from job advertisements
  and linking them to concepts in the ESCO classification. The project
  compares lexicon matching, embedding retrieval, and supervised named-entity
  recognition with separate extraction, linking, and end-to-end evaluations.
keywords:
  - natural language processing
  - skill extraction
  - job advertisements
  - ESCO
  - information extraction
